{"1232960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Treasure Hunt - Editor", "steam_appid": 1232960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan an unforgettable birthday party or game day with our innovative treasure hunt app! Perfect for parents who want to host an exciting and interactive celebration for children ages 6-12. Our app turns your PC into a magical tool for an exhilarating treasure hunt. Combine the search for waypoints or classic puzzles with quiz questions. In the course of the story, participants are guided through a fascinating world where they must answer intriguing questions. These questions are asked by magical mythical creatures. The highlight of the treasure hunt is, of course, the treasure itself – a sweet reward for successfully answering all the questions. Make your child's birthday an unforgettable experience with our treasure hunt app!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan an unforgettable birthday party or game day with our innovative treasure hunt app! Perfect for parents who want to host an exciting and interactive celebration for children ages 6-12. Our app turns your PC into a magical tool for an exhilarating treasure hunt. Combine the search for waypoints or classic puzzles with quiz questions. In the course of the story, participants are guided through a fascinating world where they must answer intriguing questions. These questions are asked by magical mythical creatures. The highlight of the treasure hunt is, of course, the treasure itself – a sweet reward for successfully answering all the questions. Make your child's birthday an unforgettable experience with our treasure hunt app!</p>", "short_description": "Plan an unforgettable birthday party or game day with our innovative treasure hunt app! Perfect for parents who want to host an exciting and interactive celebration for children ages 6-12. Our app turns your PC into a magical tool for an exhilar